  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Global Partners Governance Foundation (GPGF) Irak: St&#xe4;rkande av parlamentet</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Partners Governance Foundation (GPGF) Iraq: Strengthening Parliament - GPGF  Iraq 2022-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Huvudsyftet med bidraget &#xe4;r att bidra till en f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad utveckling av policies, lagstiftning och ansvarsskyldighet i parlamentet, motverka korruption samt f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra tillhandah&#xe5;llandet av grundl&#xe4;ggande tj&#xe4;nster. Detta kommer att ske genom samarbete med parlamentet och dess ledarm&#xf6;ten, parlamentets olika utskott samt talmannens kansli f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra kapaciteten, kunskapen, &#xf6;ppenheten och ansvarsskyldigheten.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main aim of the contribution is to support an improved policy, legislation and accountability in Parliament, tackle corruption and improve basic service delivery. This will be done by working with the Parliament, the Committees, Members of Parliament, and the Office of the Speaker to better improve capacity, knowledge, transparency and accountability</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main aim of the contribution is to support an improved policy, legislation and accountability in Parliament, tackle corruption and improve basic service delivery. This will be done by working with the Parliament, the Committees, Members of Parliament, and the Office of the Speaker to better improve capacity, knowledge, transparency and accountability.

This will be done in three project stands:

Improving policy, legislation and ministerial accountability in Parliament, 
through,

- direct support to MPs in Committees on Policy and legislation
- professionalism of the parliamentary administration
- strategic support to the Office of the Speaker

Tackling corruption through improved financial oversight, through

- direct support to the Finance Committee
- improved links between the Supreme Audit Institution and Parliamentary
  Committees 
- improved oversight skills of MPs
- enhanced audit function of all the committees


Improving local delivery by strengthening links between local and national, through,

- developed and implemented practical systems for managing casework,
  and improving the provision of local services
- work with existing regional offices to improve links between regions and
  Parliament
- turning constituency concerns into national policy and legislation</narrative>
  </description>
